      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CZECH OUT (1) ran on strongly for second here last week after winning his maiden impressively before that at Murray Bridge. If this race has not come too soon for him, then he is the one to beat. REBEL TUESDAY (2) has been facing tougher group company in Melbourne this prep, and she slots in beautifully at this level. The blinkers come off, and both of her wins to date have been over this trip. A form reversal is expected. Can win. FAST FOOD (4) had plenty of trial experience before proving to be too strong on debut for a modest maiden field on debut at Balaklava just over 2 weeks ago. This is tougher, but he won't be far away. INHABIT (7) gave a good sight in front for a long way at Mildura last start, and was only collared late. Stick with her.",
